        "method": "In a separate process, wrap sqlite3.connect to retain real Connection subclasses and count close() calls. Invoke domain.add_task, list_tasks and complete_task against a temporary database. All three connections still execute SELECT 1 after return. Close them during probe cleanup. Candidate files are unchanged."
